{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "96", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The trophy is shared 2-2 and Holder and Morgan smile. The former has plenty to take from this series but the latter, hmmm... One of the favourites for the World Cup? That tag has taken a serious beating. Questioned by the number 9 team in the world. He will hope that the Brits do well in the T20I format, which arguably, is the best for the Windies. Promises to be a cracker. Join us on Friday, Match 5, 2019 at 4 pm local (2000 GMT) for the first of a 3-match T20I series, at this very same venue in St. Lucia. ADIOS! TAKE CARE!", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T19:07:39+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "95", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Victorious Windies captain, Jason Holder, is proud of his unit. Says that it was tough on the boys after the first game but they did not lose hope. is happy with the intent they showed in spite of the demoralizing loss in the previous ODI. On Gayle, Holder says that Chris is Chris but the main focus was on the team showing positive intent with the bat and attacking intent with the ball. On the series overall, Jason says that there are still things to be learnt and this final ODI was a good learner. He observes that the middle overs are the key where England score big and today, they concentrated on restricting the boundaries and the Windies were successful. On the surface, Holder says that it was a bouncy wicket but they still needed to put it in the right areas. Credits England for starting off well in Powerplay 1 but then praises Thomas and Nurse for shutting it down in the middle overs.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T19:00:32+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "94", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "424 runs, 13 sixes. Universe Boss, CHRIS GAYLE, IS THE MAN OF THE SERIES. Take a bow. Smiles and says that he is only 39. Asks the youngsters across the world - what are they doing? Then becomes serious and praises the bowlers and Oshane Thomas for setting up the win. On the run chase, Gayle says that the 16-run opening over gave Windies plenty of momentum and he took it from there. Praises England for their bowling throughout the series, especially Mark Wood, for sheer pace. On his own self, whether this is the final innings in the Caribbean, Gayle says that he was not sure, but if this is the last, he wanted to go out with a bang. Adds further that this series status is a big boost for the Windies. They wanted to go into the World Cup with a bit of respect and he says that if the bowling attack performs like this in England, they can make a few heads turn.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:57:05+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "93", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "OSHANE THOMAS HAS BEEN NAMED THE MAN OF THE MATCH FOR HIS FIFER. Seems to be a shy guy. Politely says that the wicket seemed to have a lot for the fast bowlers and he only bowled it in the right areas. On learning at the international stage, Thomas says that the experience was great, after featuring mainly in the CPL.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:55:34+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "92", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Eoin Morgan admits that England struggled to bat throughout their innings on a bouncy track. Adds that they were way off the board and with the ball, were all over the place. Bluntly says that they did not deserve to win. Says that nothing is easy and England need to find out ways to score on challenging tracks and hang out in the middle. Stresses that the unit has done it on slower and lower wickets but need to now do it in conditions and tracks like these. On the series overall, Morgan states that England have competed well but have not been at their best. Hence, he feels that 2-2 is a fair reflection of how the series unfolded. Ends by saying that today's performance was disappointing but he will take plenty of positives from the series.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:54:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "91", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Clearly a day to forget for England. Eoin Morgan had said that they would be tested in this ODI series and they have been. But they have been blown away, to be honest, by one man. Today though, it was more due to the disciplined bowling by the Windies. It will be interesting to see what Morgan says in the presentation. Stay tuned...", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:44:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "90", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Earlier, after electing to bowl, Windies were excellent with the ball. They did not bowl loose stuff, which meant the visitors had to manufacture their shots. Batting was by no means easy but the technique against short stuff was found wanting. Not one of the top 7 had answers to the hurried bouncers. They tried to see off the passage of play but once Stokes was dismissed, the innings was ushered into completion.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:43:20+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "89", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The Caribbean is dancing in Gayle's glory. Let us join them. Christopher Henry Gayle. Retiring post the World Cup? Why? 39 sixes in a 5-match ODI series with one game less. The Universe Boss still has plenty of fuel left in the tank. His 27-ball 77 meant that the others did not have to do much and England were given a proper pasting. The number 1 ranked ODI side were asked to fetch the leather and plenty of dirty linen were washed. Battered and hammered. Beaten black and blue.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:41:32+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "88", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "We have just gone 5 minutes post the scheduled innings break, that is how quickly the match has enfolded. Those tuning in now might just read Gayle's fastest ODI Fifty but there was a team which batted before, toiled for 28 overs but mustered only 113. Only to see that being kicked off in not even half of the overs they faced.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:39:00+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "87", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "What a way to make a statement. All done, all dusted. Start the car! All over in 40.2 overs. This has been one cracking T20. Oops... was it an ODI? My word. It has been a Chris Gayle show again but do not forget who set it up in the first place.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:36:17+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.1", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "6,259,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64149", "Batsman": "64861", "Commentary": "FOUR! Windies win! Hetmyer finishes it off with a boundary. Full and on off stump from Curran, Shimron drives that one beautifully down the ground and beats the mid off fielder for a boundary. Comfortable win for the home side as they beat England with 7 wickets in hand and 227 BALLS TO SPARE!", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:34:40+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Tom Curran to have a go now.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:34:13+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.6", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "5,218,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "On off stump from Wood, Bravo off the front foot hits that through the off side. They take a couple. Just 3 to win now.", "Summary": {"Score": "111/3", "Over": "12", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4257", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "7", "Balls": "14", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "64861", "Runs": "7", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57871", "Overs": "6", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "55", "Wickets": "2"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:33:34+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "On middle and leg from Wood. Bravo paddles that one on the leg side.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:32:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "WIDE. Down the leg side, flick shot missed.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:32:02+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.4", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "Around middle and off, defended watchfully.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:31:28+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "On off stump from Wood, Bravo hits that one straight to the cover fielder.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:30:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "3,119,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "64861", "Commentary": "EDGED, SAFE! Once again Hetmyer backs away to the leg side and throws his bat at it. Gets a thick outside edge which flies over short third man! Just a single though.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:29:52+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,219,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "64861", "Commentary": "FOUR! Just outside off stump from Wood, Hetmyer gives himself room and hits that over the off side for a boundary. Just 7 needed now.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:29:09+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "On middle and leg, defended back to the bowler.", "Summary": {"Score": "103/3", "Over": "11", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4257", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "5", "Balls": "10", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "64861", "Runs": "2", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4321", "Overs": "6", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "56", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:27:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "WIDE! Bouncer is too high from the bowler Woakes. Bravo ducks underneath and lets that go to the keeper. Dot ball.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:27:22+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,288,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "FOUR! Too full in length, Bravo gives himself room to the leg side and swings hard but gets a thick inside edge. There is no mid on in place and the ball races away.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:26:28+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "On middle and off from Woakes, moves across towards slip. Bravo beaten all ends up. No run.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:25:45+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "Bouncer! The batsman ducks in time to let that one go over him.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:25:20+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "On middle and off from Woakes. Bravo defends that but straight to bowler. No run.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:24:38+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,2,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "64861", "Commentary": "Another slower ball, fuller in length, around middle, worked through mid-wicket for a single.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:24:02+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Powerplay 2 time. 4 fielders outside the 30-yard circle, till the..........40th over. Take your time...", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:23:00+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "Bouncer this time from Wood. Bravo ducks and lets that go through to the keeper. Dot to finish the over.", "Summary": {"Score": "97/3", "Over": "10", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4257", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "1", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "64861", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57871", "Overs": "5", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "47", "Wickets": "2"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:22:39+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "Nicely bowled from Wood. On off stump going away, Bravo tries to play at it, misses it. Straight to the keeper. No run.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:21:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "A short ball, around leg stump, Darren hops and fends it down.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:21:26+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "On a good length around middle, played away towards point.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:20:56+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,345,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "64861", "Commentary": "Played to the mid-wicket region by the batsman. The batsmen have run through for a single.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:20:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,199,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "4257", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, pushed through the covers for a single.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:19:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "64861", "Commentary": "Outside off, Bravo gets across and shoulders arms.", "Summary": {"Score": "95/3", "Over": "9", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "64861", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4257", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4321", "Overs": "5", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "50", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:18:20+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Shimron Hetmyer walks in at number 5, replacing Hope.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:18:05+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "OUT! BOWLED! Ugly shot from Hope and he has no hope. Windies lose their third wicket. Hope has to go. Off cutter from Woakes on off stump, Hope tries to hit that over the on side, ends up missing it and the timber is disturbed.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "63797", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:16:31+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Short this time from Woakes. Hope tries to pull that one but misses it as  the ball hits his arm.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:15:15+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "On off stump again from Woakes. Hope off the front foot defends that one. Dot ball.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:14:41+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "6,258,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, Hope lofts this over mid off and comes back for the second.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:14:15+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "On off stump from Woakes. Hope of the back foot defends it. No run.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:13:36+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Darren Bravo comes in for the finishing duties.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:12:06+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "OUT! Dragged on! The fun ends. Gayle cannot quite see his team through to the finish line. A length ball, around middle, Gayle looks to pull but the ball stays slightly low and skids through, beneath the bat. Hits the top of off. The entire crowd in Grenada stands up as one. What a champion knock. What a series he has had. The Universe Boss is back.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "1201", "Summary": {"Score": "93/2", "Over": "8", "Runs": "26", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "1201", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "77", "Balls": "27", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "9"}, {"Batsman": "63797", "Runs": "11", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57871", "Overs": "4", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "45", "Wickets": "2"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:11:20+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "1,18,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "SIX! Where has this gone? Into orbit! His 9th six. Bowled short, around middle, Gayle just clubs it leisurely over mid-wicket.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:10:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "2,65,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "FOUR! Streaky but who will care? A full toss, around middle, Gayle backs away and swings hard but gets a thick inside edge which escapes short fine leg!", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:09:19+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "3,119,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "FOUR! The upper cut again! Short and outside off, Gayle backs away and ramps it over the short third man fielder!", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:08:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "4,166,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "SIX. Raining sixes here! Short outside off stump, Gayle gives himself room again to hit that over deep point, way back in the stands for another maximum.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:07:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "4,148,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "SIX! He is dealing in maximums even on this bouncy surface. Short and outside off, Gayle backs away and upper cuts it over point!", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:06:13+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Landed outside off, punched straight to point.", "Summary": {"Score": "67/1", "Over": "7", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63797", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "11", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "1201", "Runs": "51", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "6"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4321", "Overs": "4", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "48", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:04:59+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "6,258,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "SIX! Hope gets in to the act. On middle stump little bit fuller. Hope presents full face of the bat to hit that over the bowlers head for a maximum.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:04:38+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Outside off, played straight to point.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:04:14+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "The batsman defends it from within the crease.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:03:54+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "2,69,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "Fuller in length, around off stump from Woakes. Gayle tries to swing hard but the ball takes the inside edge and goes past the stumps towards short fine leg. A single taken.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:02:53+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "A short ball outside off, Gayle rocks back to pull but misses.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:02:32+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,332,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Played through mid-wicket by the batsman. Two runs added to the total.", "Summary": {"Score": "60/1", "Over": "6", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63797", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "5", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "1201", "Runs": "50", "Balls": "19", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "6"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57871", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T18:00:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,195,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "Fifty up for Gayle of just 19 balls. Fastest in ODIs by a Windies batsman. On middle as Gayle defends that one to take a quick single.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:59:59+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "A bouncer around middle, ducked under.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:59:10+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,350,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "SIX! MURDERED! The Universe Boss is making a short work of this run chase. Short and around middle, Gayle backs away and pulls it over mid-wicket!", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:58:24+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "Backs away to the leg side and bunts it back to the bowler.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:57:31+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,345,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "SIX! Its out of here! Gayle continues on his merry ways. On middle from wood, Gayle clears his front foot and hoicks that one over deep mid-wicket.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:56:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Another LBW appeal, turned down again. This time England do not review. A length ball, around middle, Hope misses his flick and is hit on the pads. Going down leg.", "Summary": {"Score": "45/1", "Over": "5", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63797", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "3", "Balls": "8", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "1201", "Runs": "37", "Balls": "14", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "4"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4321", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "41", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:56:17+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "The batsman appears to have been struck on the thigh pad.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:55:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Around off and outside off, let through by the batsman.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:54:56+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "4,137,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Full and around middle, Hope looks to flick but gets a leading edge which goes over point. A couple taken.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:54:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Outside off, left alone.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:53:48+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "A huge shout for LBW, turned down. A length ball, around middle, Hope looks to tuck it to the leg side but misses and is hit on the pads. Woakes appeals but the umpire turns it down. England take the review but Hawk Eye signals it to be clipping the top of leg stump. So umpire's call stays. Review intact.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:53:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "The batsman goes for the pull but misses it completely.", "Summary": {"Score": "43/1", "Over": "4", "Runs": "3", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "1201", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "37", "Balls": "14", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "4"}, {"Batsman": "63797", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57871", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:50:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "The batsman has been hit on the glove or forearm.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:50:07+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "Unusual bounce. Too high to worry the batsman! The umpire signals a wide.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:49:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,28,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "On middle and off this time from wood. Hope tucks that one on the leg side. Hope off the mark.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:48:45+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Short and on off stump. Extra bounce as Gayle leaves that one through to the keeper. Umpire calls wide.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:48:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "A short ball outside off, Hope looks to tuck but misses and is hit on the pads.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:47:29+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Shai Hope walks in at number 3, replacing Campbell.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:46:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "60160", "Commentary": "OUT! BOWLED! England get something to celebrate. The length does it for the visitors. Full and around middle, Campbell looks to work across the line but the pace of Wood is too much for him. The ball whizzes past the bat's outside edge and cannons into the stumps.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "60160", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:45:17+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "60160", "Commentary": "Outside off, left alone.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:44:18+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "7,285,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "SIX! HUMONGOUS! A short ball, around off, Gayle backs away and swats it straight over the sightscreen! 23 from the over, 16 from the previous one, Windies are looking to end this before the scheduled innings break.", "Summary": {"Score": "40/0", "Over": "3", "Runs": "23", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "1201", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "37", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "4"}, {"Batsman": "60160", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4321", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "39", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:42:54+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "nb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "CAUGHT BUT IT IS A NO BALL! Gayle was correct. He knows the rules. Look at the fourth ball of the over. A short ball, signalled one bouncer for the over. Okay. You cannot find it because I did not write it. My folly. Anyways, I make up for that. So because that was one bouncer for the over, the second bouncer of the over will be a no ball. Gayle is down the track to pull but miscues it towards long leg. Simple catch for Adil Rashid and England celebrate but the Universe Boss stands his ground. It is referred upstairs and sure enough, a no ball is signalled.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:42:28+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Gone? No ball? England are celebrating but Gayle is going nowhere. He is expecting a no ball to be signalled because it could be the second bouncer of the over. Checking...", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:40:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "1,2,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "FOUR! Ho ho ho! Extraordinary short from Gayle. It is a short ball, outside leg, Chris walks down the track, opens up his body stance and swats this via a pull behind square on the leg side! The stand moves to 33 from 17 balls. with Gayle 31 from 10!", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:40:05+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "A short ball, right on middle, the Universe Boss looks to pull but misses.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:39:24+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "5,222,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "SIX MORE! This time on the off side. A length ball, outside off, Gayle backs away and slaps it over cover for half a dozen! 85 more needed now!", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:38:59+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "1,19,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "SIX! Beautifully hit! Gayle has rocketed to 21 from 7 balls. 2 fours, 2 maximums. Full and around middle and leg, Chris clears his front leg and swings it massively over mid-wicket! The stand moves to 23 from 14 balls.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:37:54+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Batsman": "1201", "Commentary": "A short ball, around middle, Gayle looks to pull but misses.", "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:37:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "60160", "Commentary": "Defended off the back foot by the batsman.", "Summary": {"Score": "17/0", "Over": "2", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "60160", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "1", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "1201", "Runs": "15", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57871", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2019-03-02T17:35:40+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57871", "Batsman": "60160", "Commentary": "WIDE. A short ball, way too high outside off, s